          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "گاؤں (gāoṅ) is inherited from Sanskrit grāma, \"a village\" (CDIAL 4368), where CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin gā̃u. Urdu writes it with ؤ and the nasal ں."
